      "text": "Section 1. Implementation of Mayoral Duties in Acquisition of Real Property Outside the City of New York for Water Supply Purposes. The Director of the Office of Operations, and staff of such Office designated by such Director, are hereby authorized to give preliminary approval to the acquisition of real property outside the City of New York for water supply purposes and to arrange and conduct any public hearing to be held pursuant to section 5-358 of the Administrative Code, including required notice thereof.",
